  "goodToKnow": "Die Körpersprache is body language: eine offene, verschlossene Körpersprache. It includes die Gestik (gestures), die Mimik (facial expressions) and die Haltung (posture). In German business culture, a firm handshake and eye contact are traditional, while too much touching can seem intrusive. Angela Merkel's Raute (hands forming a diamond) became famous body language. It has no plural."
